#QLCIR-G1
# name: binary_exhaustive_d2
# family: physics/dichotomic-completeness
# expected: UNSAT
# physical: Completeness of an ideal dichotomic quantum proposition: event or orthogonal complement exhausts the Hilbert space.
# note: Asks for a nonzero state outside both a yes/no event and its orthocomplement.
dim(2)
output(4)
1 = not(click)
2 = or(click, 1)
3 = not(2)
4 = and(state, 3)
